WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:01.800
Come here quickly!

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.020
Come here immediately!

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.720
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.020
Say bye-bye to the teacher after class!

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.530
And bring back your gym clothes!

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:24.400
Wanna gather at the schoolyard to play?

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.160
Aren't you gonna give a good excuse?

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.710
Just leave that homework alone!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.700
Let's swing around the metal bars instead!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.770
That red backpack sure is strong

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:42.350
One, two, line up in threes!

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.880
And dash forward with the pencil case after school!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:49.950
You'll forget about it, so cheer up!

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:49.950
One

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:49.950
Two!

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:52.470
Hey Mr.! Turn around that corner!

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:56.760
Let's have a large assembly in the schoolyard!

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.100
Just who am I?

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:04.990
Can I still have fun when I grow up?

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:09.700
I don't know, but I just wanna know!

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:15.060
If we can still laugh over the small matters

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.660
I'm happy enough with that!

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.340
This! That! And everything else!

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:27.200
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:40.690
Although it's already spring, the air is still chilly.

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:55.690
You...

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:57.470
Is maintaining that image of yours that important to you?

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:58.860
Wha-?!

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.960
W-What do you mean by my image?

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.900
I-I-It sure seems a lot warmer today, isn't it?!

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.930
What kind of legendary assassin are you, anyway?!

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:09.220
Aren't you trying a bit too hard?

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.390
Good grief.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:15.240
Your face's beet red. Don't you also have a fever?

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:18.210
Eh? Mitsuba, you're quite considerate, aren't you?

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.670
W-What are you saying?!

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:21.710
It'd just be troublesome if I were to catch what she's got, you know!

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.270
Jeez!

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:31.600
Mitsuba?! Someone take her to the infirmary, please!

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:33.620
It's so disgusting. I refuse.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:36.680
My nose is so itchy...

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:42.340
Today, I will teach you what averages are and show you how to find them.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:42.870
First of all...

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.400
My nose won't stop running!

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.840
If it continues like this, I might die from dehydration!

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.520
Woe is me!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.040
Th-The tissues are...?!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:12.340
Are the paper gods really abandoning me now?!

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.530
Well, if that's the case, I can use notebook pages...

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:17.200
I-It's no good!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.420
I don't want to waste these sketches!

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:23.290
But damn, these scrawls actually turned out really good!

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.750
There's nothing more that can be done.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.270
I didn't even bring my textbook today.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:42.710
Then, after you divide by the number of people, you get the average, hence...

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:44.730
Ah! Yabe-chi!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.390
What is it, Futaba?

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:50.810
Teacher, you made a mistake on that character.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:53.380
Yabe-chi!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.600
Teacher, the character is wrong!

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.010
Yabe-chi!

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:59.690
Teacher, check the character!

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:00.970
Yabe-chi!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:01.910
Teacher, your mistake!

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:02.920
Yabe-chi!

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:06.880
Enough already... Don't talk all at once, please!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:08.750
Jeez...

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.130
Gosh! It's just getting longer!

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.040
Yabe-chi.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.880
I will retract it now!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:18.300
What the...?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.750
Stop spinning around! Fix the mistake, already!

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.560
E-Even if you say that, I...

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.210
I'm so sorry!

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:31.310
I-It won't let me move!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:35.920
Then, the average from these four people is 8.6 seconds.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.480
Person A took 7.8 seconds...

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:42.820
Yabe-chi is a genius at the art of hypnotism...

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:40.840
Person B took...

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.830
Person C took 20.5 seconds...

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:47.350
But... I won't be able to sleep with this thick string of snot on my arms!

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:52.340
Then again, I can't fight this drowsiness creeping up on me...

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.050
What the hell is this?!

00:04:58.050 --> 00:04:59.670
You disgust me...

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.880
Lay forward when you snooze!

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:05.360
More importantly, can't you remember to shut your eyes when you sleep?!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.970
You idiot!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:16.100
What the hell is with this filthy arm of yours?!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.740
Gosh... She's so noisy...

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.740
I can't believe you!

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:19.620
It's absurdly gross!

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:22.210
God, just wake up already, you oaf!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:38.180
Er, Mitsuba? If you sleep on the floor like that, you'll catch a cold, you know.

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:41.760
Someone please carry her over to the infirmary!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.530
Since she's dirty, I don't want to.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.390
I'm really sorry...

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:55.970
...for having you to care for my students each and every time.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.740
No, no, it's fine. It's great that they're so lively.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:01.950
Erm... Disinfectant, antiseptic...

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:07.090
Mitsuba, your face looks just like Japan's flag!

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:10.150
Futaba, you idiot!

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.960
To deliver or to be punished... Rock, paper, scissors!

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.940
You're too slow!

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.760
Go away already!

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.280
Damn you!

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:27.460
Why can't you just follow the rules?! Are you trying to kill me?!

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:29.760
Come on, Mitsuba...

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.510
I'm from Class 4-1.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.060
I've come to deliver the urine test samples.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:34.550
Alright!

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:37.950
Thank you, I appreciate your efforts!

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:43.320
Whoa... That's urine from 30 people, isn't it?

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:44.850
That's right!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.330
Ah, the urine is...

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.670
Eh? She tripped over nothing!

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.320
Would she happen to be the legendary klutz master?!

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:58.940
How troublesome!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:00.830
Miss Kuriyama! Your knees!

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.320
You're crushing them with your knees!

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:03.360
Eh...?

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.430
No way!

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:16.280
The urine... It's all over!

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:19.600
Miss Kuriyama... Are you oka-whoa!

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:25.870
It's a Pandora's box of urine!

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:29.780
Um, sorry, but there's a girl sleeping over there, so please be quieter-

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:32.150
This is all your fault, though!

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:34.300
In any case, can you disinfect me now?!

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.420
Do you intend to kill me by letting me bleed out?!

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:39.200
P-Please calm down...

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.370
You urine-covered idiot! Don't touch me!

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.920
I'm so sorry!

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.810
That was most shameful of me...

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.720
Everyone makes mistakes, you know.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.370
Well, if only I wasn't so pathetic...

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.230
Yeah, right... Jeez...

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.330
God, this smells!

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.640
Is this actually urine?!

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.640
Oh, no! I can't believe I made that mistake!

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:08.380
Why is a qualified nurse making these mistakes?! Do you intend to kill me by blood poisoning?!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.700
No, you're wrong! I'm sorry!

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:14.040
Enough, I'll do it myself.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.830
I just know that I don't have enough lives to withstand any more of this!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.130
Here you go.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.270
Thanks.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:28.210
You idiot Futaba!

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:32.200
You're the reason we got into this mess!

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.930
Please don't feel too down about this.

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:41.510
Maybe I'm not even fit for this job...

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:44.590
That's urine! It's urine, Nurse!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:48.530
U-Urine?! I mistook this for milk!

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:58.980
You're just tired, surely...

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:00.750
Is that really it, I wonder...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.560
Were you listening?! I already told you that's urine!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.790
No!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.710
I've had enough!

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:10.250
That's my line, you fool!

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:14.300
Nurse, here are the samples from Class 3-4.

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:20.920
Carefully... Gently...

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.480
It'd be good to calm down!

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.480
Please watch your step!

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:26.480
Y-Yes!

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:32.310
Don't get caught in that trap!

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.830
Leave it to me! I'll get rid of any obstacles!

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.950
Ah-Thank you...

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:44.770
Erm... San- Mitsu- Futou- Mitsuru!

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.040
I'm Futaba!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.590
I'd like you to remember that, at least...

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:52.990
So, you're putting the urine here?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:58.770
Gently...

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:01.290
Ever so gently, put it down...

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.040
O-Okay.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:09.500
I-I did it!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.160
Congratulations!

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.510
Kuriyama-chi, you did it!

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:23.710
Ah, you're stepping on them again, Miss Kuriyama!

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:29.300
This is just like the Meiji Restoration- for urine!

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:31.210
How noisy.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:37.920
I just didn't realize!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.520
This amount of stress could kill just about anyone.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.550
Miss Kuriyama...

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:04.290
Although it may come as a surprise, I'm really on a diet...

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:11.080
Enough already, Miss Kuriyama. It tickles. No, not there...

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:15.210
Haven't you noticed the people watching...?

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:21.070
NO!!!

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.680
H-Have mercy on me...!

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:24.740
Save me...!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:28.540
I-I'm so sorry... really sorry!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.520
Wait, Hitoha?! I'm sorry!

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:33.610
Why were you so evil-looking a moment ago?!

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.020
Good morning.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.740
Wait, why did you come here, anyway?

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.220
I came to see Nipples.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:45.450
Ah... Since it's Saturday, and no one is at school, I'm taking care of it.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:49.400
Hey, my door was locked, wasn't it?!

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.110
Between classes, I decided to make myself a spare key.

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:55.080
You made that by hand?!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:59.670
Although that's amazing, it's illegal, you know!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:09.190
Hitoha. You know, it's not like you can't come here...

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:12.800
But I'd like you to make a proper appointment...

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.340
I <i>did</i> make an appointment with Nipples.

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:16.970
No, I meant with me!

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:20.170
I came here just to see Nipples, though.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:24.570
Don't mind me, please go ahead and read your porn magazines.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:25.860
Would I even?!

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:29.110
Even though you seem to see me as thin air at school...

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:31.180
Just now, you got freaked out.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:34.000
That's not what I've been thinking, you know!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.100
That's a lie.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:41.620
Every weekend, even though I'm imposing, you don't seem to notice I'm here.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.470
I wasn't lying-

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:46.030
What?! Every week?!

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:49.030
My existence is like that to you, is it?

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.030
T-That's not true!

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:55.440
I really do give you my attention! I'm always watching over you, Hitoha!

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:58.010
Teacher...

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.550
I'm always watching over you, Hitoha!

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:12.140
I'm always watching over you, Hitoha!

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:16.770
Here, take Nipples.

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:20.630
What you just said...

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:24.300
If the school counsel heard that... I wonder what they'd do.

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.590
I'll come back again tomorrow.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:47.150
She still hasn't come over?!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.750
Well, it is only 5 o'clock, huh?

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:56.090
Nipples isn't there?!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:00.410
Did he escape during the night?!

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:03.140
What should I do now?!

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:15.950
Hitoha is coming!

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.350
Where's my Nipples?

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.930
WHERE'S MY NIPPLES?!

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:24.310
My own little sanctuary will be completely ransacked!

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:39.350
Nipples, where are you?

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.520
Nipples...?

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.580
Nipples?! Nipples?!

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:56.210
Nipples?! Nipples?! Please respond!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:22.780
Teacher, I know you're there.

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:24.400
So scary...

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.360
If you don't hurry up and let me in, I'll expose that recording...

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:30.170
To Miss Kuriyama, too, of course...

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.150
Nipples, where are you?!

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:35.120
Ah, there he is!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.430
Wait!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:39.830
At this rate, he'll run outside!

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.390
Hitoha, close the door!

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.140
Nipples.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:04.590
I wanted to see you.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:09.670
Um...

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:14.180
Would it be possible for us to take turns caring for Nipples during the weekends?

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:18.300
I did say that I'd take care of him, but my house is more dangerous than I thought.

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:23.590
Aw, how careless of me!

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:28.850
I just wanna squeeze this small, fragile thing! I wanna crush it!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.200
Is that so?

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:46.400
To think that you'd help me catch these cicadas!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.880
You're really nice today, huh?

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.300
It's fine!

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:52.490
Being your older sister, it's natural to do so.

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:58.080
I just can't wait to see her face when I "accidentally" crush that creature!

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:02.350
I look forward to seeing her fall into despair!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:06.430
It's better to go higher, you know-

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:09.990
Alright, heave-ho!

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:10.750
It hurts!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:11.800
Stop-

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.270
I quit!

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:26.230
You better watch this!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.480
I will show you what true despair is!

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:32.380
I got a catch!

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:33.580
Take a look!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.130
It's a red swamp crayfish!

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.770
That's awesome!

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:37.610
Good going!

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:44.640
Here's one!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:05.740
Fu-Futaba!

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:09.210
Just where did she go off to?!

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:11.490
I need to calm down!

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:14.880
If only I could swing and get myself closer to the trunk...

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:21.420
Is that the cicada from earlier?!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:22.930
Y-You're in the way!

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.930
If you don't move now, I'll crush you!

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:31.100
It's not like I pity you or anything...

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.720
I just don't want to get my hands dirty, you know!

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:35.930
That's why I'm stopping in my tracks!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:37.590
What's that about?

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.090
This voice is...?!

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.580
These are... legs?!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:44.900
It's Satou and Chibaru from our class!

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:45.820
P-Please help-

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:52.150
Based on what I can profile from these panties, I deduct that this person is a kindergartner!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.490
A kindergartner?!

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:57.560
How could I...

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:02.390
...a sixth grader who possesses more than enough influence, be confused for a kindergartner?!

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:06.590
If they found out that I love panties for kindergartners...

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:10.630
No!!!

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:14.030
The stature and prestige that I've amassed thus far will come to nothing!

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:16.080
Just what is this profiling thing you're yapping about?

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:20.240
Hey there! Though I don't know who you are, let me help you out of there.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.030
Ouch!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.670
Satou!

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:26.970
Hey you!

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:29.160
We said that we'd help you out-!

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:32.790
I'm just some random kindergartner!

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.430
Go away, already!

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:36.120
W-What's with this girl?

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:39.500
That kind of strength... It's definitely not of a 5- or 6-year-old!

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:42.470
Just go away already! Leave immediately!

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.830
Leave this very instant!

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:44.830
You idiot!

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:46.950
Just hang there your whole life, then!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.180
Let's go, Satou!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.560
Ah-Okay!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.600
I just recklessly consumed some of my strength...

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:09.460
Big sis! Bye-bye!

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:11.510
Let's do this again!

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:15.080
It's a jackpot of crayfish!

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.970
Since the crows are cawing, it's time for me to go home!

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:24.860
I got a jackpot, jackpot, jackpot~!

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:30.090
I'll make no progress at this rate.

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.330
To fall down, or to crush it...

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:33.560
That's right!

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:36.490
Generally speaking, a cicada's lifespan is only about a week...

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:40.860
If we compare the importance of an insect's life against my own, of course the decision is...!

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:04.250
I'm home.

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:12.110
Hitoha, I went fishing for crayfish!

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:15.260
I got a jackpot, you know!

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:18.970
By tearing off a live frog's skin, you can use it as bait to catch them!

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:23.110
Ah, Mitsuba! Welcome home!

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.190
Where did you go off to?

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:31.830
Y-You...!

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:32.660
You demon!

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:35.130
You're actually a demon in sheep's clothing, aren't you?!

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:37.830
You went home without me just to spite me, didn't you?!

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.470
Ah, I completely forgot!

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:40.100
Just die!

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:41.320
Die now!!!

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:42.870
It was my bad!

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:44.880
I'm at fault, I know!

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.270
Mitsuba, you're so dirty.

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:48.140
Please leave the house immediately.

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.320
I'm hurt, you know?!

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:51.180
Can't you just feel a lil' sorry for me?!

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:54.320
God! Everyone can just die!

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:22.160
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:27.450
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:32.670
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:32.780 --> 00:22:37.910
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:43.460
Let's go to sleep

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:47.410
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:54.500
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:59.450
You can even fly into the sky

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:14.000
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:14.070 --> 00:23:19.410
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:29.370
There were many vacant lots around here a while ago, huh?

00:23:29.370 --> 00:23:32.350
The development of those areas is incredible. There are less vacant lots now.

00:23:32.350 --> 00:23:36.020
Those were the best places to discover the greatest porn, too!

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:37.460
Dammit!

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:38.960
Er, isn't that irrelevant?!
